                  "text": "Law 26:30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ukisema, Enyi milima ya Israeli, lisikieni neno la Bwana MUNGU; Bwana MUNGU aiambia hivi milima na vilima, na vijito na mabonde; Tazama, mimi, naam, mimi, nitaleta upanga juu yenu, nami nitapaharibu mahali penu palipoinuka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
